        "text": {
          "status": "generated",
          "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h2>Prostate Health Index and Early Cancer Biomarker Panel</h2><p><b>Conclusion:</b> Patient has an elevated Prostate Health Index (phi = 47.8) in this synthetic test result, indicating an elevated probability of clinically significant prostate cancer (Gleason Score >= 7) on biopsy.</p></div>"
